=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Saldinor} in {z:Rala Waterways} (F-10) to begin the quest.
** The Southeastern Entrance from {z:Western Adoulin} Waypoint #6 (Rent-a-room) (I-12) is closest to NPC.
* Obtain 2 {i:Twitherym Wings|Twitherym Wing|3930} and trade them to {n:Saldinor} to obtain your reward.
** May be purchased from the {z:Auction House} under Materials -> Clothcrafting.
** {z:Ceizak Battlegrounds} (G-10) has a small camp of {p:Twitherym} that is easier to reach.
** {z:Yahse Hunting Grounds} (I-8) has a decently sized camp of {p:Twitherym} just beyond a {p:Colonization Reive}.
** {z:Outer Ra'Kaznar} Map 1 (F/G-6) has a small camp of {p:Twitherym} if you or a friend can reach it.
* Repeat of this quest still give 500 {p:Experience Points} or {p:Limit Points}.

A special note on repeating this quest:
* This quest is repeatable, but **only** after completing {q:A Shot in the Dark|A Shot in the Dark|A Shot in the Dark}.
** That is, all three quests must be completed, in order each time, to repeat any of them.
* Questline : It Sets My Heart Aflutter -> {q:A Good Pair of Crocs|A Good Pair of Crocs|A Good Pair of Crocs} -> {q:A Shot in the Dark|A Shot in the Dark|A Shot in the Dark} -> repeat.

